* LM13700 half — datasheet macromodel (convergent)
* Iout = Iabc · tanh(Vd / (2·Vt)), bias pin sinks to VSS.
* Linearizing diodes (LIN) and buffer (BIN/BUF) left unused — open / tied off.
*
* Pins: LIN INP INN IAB OUT VCC VSS BIN BUF
* Matches deanm1278 / idea2ic pin order so enc_*.sub stay unchanged.
*
* Refs: TI LM13700 datasheet transfer; circuit-review.md §4 (±224 mV → full steer).

.SUBCKT HALF13700 LIN INP INN IAB OUT VCC VSS BIN BUF
* Sense bias current into IAB (toward VSS)
Viabc IAB VSS DC 0
* Core OTA
Bota 0 OUT I = { i(Viabc) * tanh(v(INP,INN) / (2*0.026)) }
Rout OUT 0 100Meg
* Unused pins: weak ties so floating nodes don't orphan
Rlin LIN VSS 100Meg
Rbin BIN VSS 100Meg
Rbuf BUF VSS 100Meg
* Supply load (quiescent ~1 mA class, datasheet order)
Rq VCC VSS 24k
.ENDS HALF13700
